# Line endings are load-bearing in this repository, not a style preference.
#
# Citations are verified by character offset into the source text: the system
# records that a quote sits at position N and re-checks it there. Git's Windows
# default (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, which shifts
# every offset after the first line and would break citation verification on a
# reviewer's machine while it kept passing on ours.
#
# The same text is embedded in the cached model responses, the analysis snapshot
# and the evaluation bundle, so the rule applies repo-wide rather than to data/
# alone — a cached prompt that gains carriage returns no longer matches its key,
# and every cache hit silently becomes a miss.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
